{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39760380",
      "title": "Handling Events & Using Two-Way-Binding",
      "sourceHash": "4d9b16ea77603f53154d18d8a1c4a35fc71ee371040a76e62dcef8f207005b54",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 2.88,
          "en": "And therefore, here to get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.88,
          "end": 6.27,
          "en": "and store these values entered by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.27,
          "end": 8.58,
          "en": "We need to manage some state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.58,
          "end": 10.503,
          "en": "in this userInput component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.4,
          "end": 16.05,
          "en": "Therefore, we should import useState from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.05,
          "end": 19.58,
          "en": "So this special React hook which we can use to register",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.58,
          "end": 22.773,
          "en": "and manage some state in a component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.18,
          "end": 27.18,
          "en": "And then we can call this useState hook here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.18,
          "end": 28.71,
          "en": "in this component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.71,
          "end": 30.66,
          "en": "And it is now up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.66,
          "end": 34.56,
          "en": "if you want to manage four different states",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.56,
          "end": 37.86,
          "en": "for these four different input fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.86,
          "end": 42.39,
          "en": "Or if you want to have one state object that kind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.39,
          "end": 47.39,
          "en": "of merges all these different input values into one object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.85,
          "end": 50.61,
          "en": "And I'll go for the latter approach here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.61,
          "end": 55.323,
          "en": "But as mentioned, it is up to you which approach you prefer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.47,
          "end": 59.83,
          "en": "And in that object, I'll have an initialInvestment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 61.26,
          "end": 65.869,
          "en": "which initially might be set to $10,000 as a default value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 65.869,
          "end": 68.163,
          "en": "though that of course is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 69.03,
          "end": 71.25,
          "en": "I'll have my annualInvestment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 71.25,
          "end": 73.773,
          "en": "which could be $1,200.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 75.39,
          "end": 78.063,
          "en": "I'll have my expectedReturn,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 79.05,
          "end": 81.743,
          "en": "which could be let's say 6%.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.49,
          "end": 85.77,
          "en": "And I'll add a duration property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.77,
          "end": 87.843,
          "en": "with a default duration of 10.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 89.01,
          "end": 93.72,
          "en": "So that's now the initial state assigned to this state here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 93.72,
          "end": 97.14,
          "en": "And now of course we need to get back these two elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 97.14,
          "end": 101.31,
          "en": "and store them in constants so that we can work with them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 101.31,
          "end": 103.44,
          "en": "And here I'll name these constants",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 103.44,
          "end": 106.32,
          "en": "userInput and set userInput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 106.32,
          "end": 110.31,
          "en": "Since that's in the end, what this state is all about, it is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 110.31,
          "end": 115.18,
          "en": "about managing and storing the input provided by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 115.18,
          "end": 117.39,
          "en": "Now, we of course, also need a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 117.39,
          "end": 121.8,
          "en": "that should be triggered whenever we change the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 121.8,
          "end": 125.373,
          "en": "in these input fields so that we can update this state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 126.39,
          "end": 130.41,
          "en": "And for this here, we could add four functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 130.41,
          "end": 131.88,
          "en": "one for every input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 131.88,
          "end": 135.74,
          "en": "or one generic function that can actually be connected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 135.74,
          "end": 137.46,
          "en": "to all inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 137.46,
          "end": 139.443,
          "en": "And I'll go for data approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 141.42000000000002,
          "end": 144.007,
          "en": "I'll add a function which I'll name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 144.007,
          "end": 145.047,
          "en": "\"HandleChange.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.88,
          "end": 151.78,
          "en": "And in this function, I expect to get the new value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 151.78,
          "end": 154.32999999999998,
          "en": "that was entered for a given input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 154.32999999999998,
          "end": 157.59300000000002,
          "en": "But I also expect to get the inputIdentifier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 159.6,
          "end": 163.32,
          "en": "So I expect to get these two parameters here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 163.32,
          "end": 166.41,
          "en": "in this function so that inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 166.41,
          "end": 168.63,
          "en": "of this handleChange function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 168.63,
          "end": 170.103,
          "en": "we can call setUserInput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 172.11,
          "end": 174.653,
          "en": "And then I wanna update this state based",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 174.653,
          "end": 177.18,
          "en": "on the previous state value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 177.18,
          "end": 180.6,
          "en": "because when this handle change function executes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 180.6,
          "end": 184.83,
          "en": "only one of these four properties will be updated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 184.83,
          "end": 187.11,
          "en": "And of course the other properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 187.11,
          "end": 189.84,
          "en": "and their values shouldn't be lost.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 189.84,
          "end": 193.62,
          "en": "Therefore, the updated state must depend on the old state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 193.62,
          "end": 196.59,
          "en": "so that we still have the old data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 196.59,
          "end": 199.383,
          "en": "for the inputs that were not changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 200.95,
          "end": 203.28,
          "en": "Therefore here, as you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 203.28,
          "end": 205.8,
          "en": "we should use this function form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 205.8,
          "end": 209.943,
          "en": "for updating the state where we get the previous userInput",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 210.96,
          "end": 215.96,
          "en": "and where we then return our updated state object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 217,
          "end": 222,
          "en": "And I'll start by spreading the old userInput state object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 222.03,
          "end": 226.98,
          "en": "into this new object so that we copy all the old values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 226.98,
          "end": 229.07999999999998,
          "en": "into this new object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 229.07999999999998,
          "end": 233.76,
          "en": "And I then just override one single property of that object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 233.76,
          "end": 236.61,
          "en": "And that property should be identified",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 236.61,
          "end": 240.87,
          "en": "with help of that inputIdentifier parameter here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 240.87,
          "end": 244.71,
          "en": "So the expectation here is that inputIdentifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 244.71,
          "end": 246.952,
          "en": "will get a string as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 246.952,
          "end": 249.352,
          "en": "that either is initialInvestment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 249.352,
          "end": 253.53,
          "en": "or annualInvestment, or expectedReturn,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 253.53,
          "end": 258.47,
          "en": "or duration so that we can use this JavaScript syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 258.47,
          "end": 261.81,
          "en": "to dynamically set a property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 261.81,
          "end": 266.61,
          "en": "depending on which value is stored in inputIdentifier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 266.61,
          "end": 270.6,
          "en": "And I want to set that property of that name that's stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 270.6,
          "end": 273.31,
          "en": "in this parameter to this new value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 273.31,
          "end": 276.513,
          "en": "which we're also getting as a parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 277.83,
          "end": 278.76,
          "en": "And with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 278.76,
          "end": 282.39,
          "en": "we got a pretty generic handle change function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 282.39,
          "end": 285.003,
          "en": "which we now have to connect to our inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 286.92,
          "end": 289.14,
          "en": "Now, as you learned before in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 289.14,
          "end": 291.6,
          "en": "you can add the onChange prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 291.6,
          "end": 294.84000000000003,
          "en": "to add a listener to the change event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 294.84000000000003,
          "end": 296.55,
          "en": "to this input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 296.55,
          "end": 298.65,
          "en": "And you can then define which function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 298.65,
          "end": 301.953,
          "en": "should get executed when that change event occurs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 303.3,
          "end": 306.6,
          "en": "Now just pointing at handle change like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 306.6,
          "end": 310.13,
          "en": "so at this handle change function here won't work though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 310.13,
          "end": 314.46,
          "en": "because by default when the change event occurs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 314.46,
          "end": 316.83,
          "en": "React will call this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 316.83,
          "end": 320.28,
          "en": "and pass the event object to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 320.28,
          "end": 323.34,
          "en": "A default event object that is automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 323.34,
          "end": 325.233,
          "en": "generated by React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 326.34,
          "end": 330.24,
          "en": "But whilst this event object will contain useful data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 330.24,
          "end": 333.387,
          "en": "it will not hold the inputIdentifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 333.387,
          "end": 337.38,
          "en": "and it will also just be one parameter instead of two,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 337.38,
          "end": 338.853,
          "en": "which we're expecting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 339.9,
          "end": 342.9,
          "en": "Therefore, we have to use a trick about which you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 342.9,
          "end": 346.17,
          "en": "learn earlier in the course where we create a new",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 346.17,
          "end": 348.39,
          "en": "anonymous function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 348.39,
          "end": 350.7,
          "en": "which is then the actual function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 350.7,
          "end": 353.61,
          "en": "that's passed as a value to onChange.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 353.61,
          "end": 356.58,
          "en": "And that will be executed by React eventually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 356.58,
          "end": 361.26,
          "en": "once the change event occurs and inside of this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 361.26,
          "end": 363.84,
          "en": "we therefore then have full control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 363.84,
          "end": 368.073,
          "en": "over how handle change will eventually be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 369.12,
          "end": 370.83,
          "en": "And therefore, now we can make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 370.83,
          "end": 375.03,
          "en": "that we pass those two arguments to handle change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 375.03,
          "end": 379.35,
          "en": "And the first argument should be the identifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 379.35,
          "end": 380.7,
          "en": "Which as mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 380.7,
          "end": 383.73,
          "en": "should be one of these four properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 383.73,
          "end": 385.5,
          "en": "And for this first input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 385.5,
          "end": 387.113,
          "en": "which is about the initialInvestment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 387.113,
          "end": 390.24,
          "en": "it will be this property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 390.24,
          "end": 392.79,
          "en": "So that will be my identifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 392.79,
          "end": 395.853,
          "en": "passed to handle change as a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 397.23,
          "end": 398.90999999999997,
          "en": "And the second value, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 398.90999999999997,
          "end": 401.391,
          "en": "should be the value entered by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 401.391,
          "end": 405.12,
          "en": "Now we can get that with help of that event object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 405.12,
          "end": 407.19,
          "en": "and we do get that event object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 407.19,
          "end": 409.56,
          "en": "in this anonymous function now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 409.56,
          "end": 412.92,
          "en": "Because it is this anonymous function that is passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 412.92,
          "end": 414.72,
          "en": "as a value to onChange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 414.72,
          "end": 418.08,
          "en": "and that will be called by React, therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 418.08,
          "end": 421.86,
          "en": "Hence this anonymous arrow function in my case here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 421.86,
          "end": 423.913,
          "en": "will get this event object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 423.913,
          "end": 425.88,
          "en": "And this event object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 425.88,
          "end": 427.68,
          "en": "as you learned before in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 427.68,
          "end": 431.546,
          "en": "has a target property which will refer to this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 431.546,
          "end": 435.09,
          "en": "And this input has a value property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 435.09,
          "end": 438.273,
          "en": "which will be the value entered by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 439.56,
          "end": 442.5,
          "en": "And with that, we're now calling handle change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 442.5,
          "end": 446.4,
          "en": "with our identifier and the value entered by the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 446.4,
          "end": 449.703,
          "en": "so that we should be able to update the state correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 451.215,
          "end": 455.85,
